Controls & Instrumentation Athens, Ohio Under general direction of a lead worker or supervision by departmental administrator performs highly skilled installation, repair, & preventive maintenance on Building Automation System Controls; periodically inspects operation of equipment. Provides work direction, training and mentoring of lower-level air quality technicians and/or other trades workers performing craft duties.Adheres to ... View Details Bookmark Manager, Zone Maintenance 08/27/2026 09/10/2026 Zone Maintenance Athens, Ohio View Details Bookmark Department Administrator 08/25/2026 09/09/2026 Admissions Athens, Ohio View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Instruction, Child Development Center (Teacher) 08/22/2026 09/13/2026 Child Development Center Athens, Ohio Context: The Patton College has four Core Values: 1) Preparing ethical and reflective leader-educators and human service professionals, 2) Lifelong learning, 3) Change agency and 4) Diversity. At its core, the College is committed to serving a diverse student population that includes international and non-traditional students and to providing service to the region through professional engagemen... View Details Bookmark Student Social Media & Digital Engagement Assistant 08/21/2026 09/06/2026 VP For Research Athens, Ohio The Ohio Innovation Exchange (OIEx) is seeking a student to support the digital communications and social media presence, with a primary focus on LinkedIn. OIEx is a statewide initiative led by OHIO that connects Ohio businesses, industries, and organizations with the expertise, facilities, and resources of Ohio’s colleges and universities.Create, schedule, and publish social media content, pri... View Details Bookmark Success Advisor 08/21/2026 09/05/2026 Provost Office Athens, Ohio View Details Bookmark Records Management Specialist 08/21/2026 09/07/2026 Registrar's Office Athens, Ohio Oversees file storage and records management. Organizes, converts, and integrates files for storage. Locates and retrieves records as requested.  Job Responsibilities • Provides customer service to students, staff, faculty, parents, and others in the University community by solving problems regarding records and/or data. • May lead and/or supervise TAS staff and/or student employees. • Coordina... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 Next Ohio University Human Resources | Grosvenor West 103 | 1 Ohio University | Athens, OH 45701| T: 740.593.1636 | F: 740.593.0386 Ohio University | Athens OH 45701 | 740.593.1000 ADA Compliance | © 2011 Ohio University. All rights reserved. uhr@ohio.edu To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
