etails Bookmark Art History Instructor - Athens Campus, School of Art + Design (POOL POSTING) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 Art Athens, Ohio Applications to this pool will be utilized to fill non-tenure track, non-benefits eligible Instructor positions for delivering in-person courses at the Athens Campus for our Art History Department during the 2026/2027 academic year.We are looking for industry professionals for potential instructional opportunities in Art + Design. View Details Bookmark Interior Architecture Instructor - Athens Campus, School of Art + Design (Pool Posting) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 Art Athens, Ohio Applications to this pool will be utilized to fill non-tenure track, non-benefits eligible Instructor positions for delivering in-person courses at the Athens Campus in our Interior Architecture Department during the 2026/2027 academic year. View Details Bookmark Interior Architecture Instructor - Asynchronous Online Program, School of Art + Design (Pool Posting) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 Art Athens, Ohio Applications to this pool will be utilized to fill non-tenure track, non-benefits eligible Instructor positions for delivering asynchronous online courses in our Interior Architecture – Online Program during the 2026/2027 academic year. View Details Bookmark School of Film Online Instructor (POOL POSTING) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 School of Film Athens, Ohio This is a pool posting for potential Instructor needs that may arise for Summer 2026 and Academic Year 2026-27 in Film.We are looking for industry professionals for potential instructional opportunities to reach online asynchronous courses in Film. View Details Bookmark School of Film On-Campus Instructors (POOL POSTING) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 School of Film Athens, Ohio This is a pool posting for potential Instructor needs that may arise for Summer 2026 and Academic Year 2026-27 in Film.This posting is for teaching in-person synchronous courses at the Athens campus. Course topics will vary based on need, but may include Film Studies, Screenwriting, or Film Production.We are looking for industry professionals for potential instructional opportunities in Film. View Details Bookmark School of Dance Online Instructors (POOL POSTING) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 School of Dance Athens, Ohio This is a pool posting for potential Instructor needs that may arise for Summer 2026 and Academic Year 2026-27 in Dance.We are looking for industry professionals for potential instructional opportunities in Dance to teach online courses as needed. View Details Bookmark School of Dance On-Campus Instructors (POOL POSTING) 02/16/2026 02/16/2027 School of Dance Athens, Ohio This is a pool posting for potential Instructor needs that may arise for Summer 2026 and Academic Year 2026-27 in Dance.We are looking for industry professionals for potential instructional opportunities in Dance to teach on-campus courses as needed. View Details Bookmark Instructor, Psychology (non-tenure track, part-time) (POOL) 02/10/2026 02/09/2027 Psychology Athens, Ohio Applications to this pool will be considered to fill part-time, non-tenure track, non-benefits eligible instructor positions for the Department of Psychology. View Details Bookmark Instructor Teacher Education Pool Posting AY 2026-2027, Curriculum and Instruction 02/05/2026 01/30/2027 Teacher Education Athens, Ohio The Gladys W. and David H. Patton College of Education prepares graduates who are CALLED to LEAD: Change Agents who are Lifelong Learners committed to Embracing Diversity and LEADership. Our leader-educators, practitioners, and human service professionals share our commitment to serving society responsibly as change agents in meeting diverse human and social needs.The number of Teacher Educatio... View Details Bookmark POOL: Data Analytics Instructor 01/30/2026 12/31/2026 University College, Dean's Office Athens, Ohio University College offers several courses for students pursuing a successful completion of their degree(s). A few of the courses offered are:1) Data Analytics courses (DATA 2100, 3510) introduce the fundamental concepts, principles, and tools of data analytics. They also teach key principles of analytic design and useful visualization techniques for the exploration and presentation of data.2) S... View Details Bookmark Instructor, Biomedical Sciences (part-time, non-tenure track, POOL POSTING) Campus of Choice 01/07/2026 01/07/2027 HCOM - Biomedical Sciences Athens, Ohio, Dublin, Ohio, Cleveland, Ohio Instructors are needed to teach in the areas of human anatomy, physiology, histology and/or other general biomedical science related specialties in the Heritage College of Osteopathic Medicine. Teaching workload can include but is not limited to classroom group learning activities (preparing teaching objectives, reading lists, learning assessments, creating pre-recorded tutorials and problem se... View Details Bookmark POOL Posting – Instructor, Counseling and Higher Education (Non-Tenure Track) 12/02/2025 11/30/2026 Counseling and Higher Education Athens, Ohio Instructors selected from this pool will teach courses within the Department of Counseling and Higher Education. Courses may include foundations of counseling, group counseling, ethics, assessment, multicultural counseling, career counseling, practicum or internship supervision, and other program-specific offerings depending on departmental needs. Courses may be online, in-person, or hybrid. View Details Bookmark Instructor, Pharmacy, Adjunct, Non Tenure Track, (POOL POSTING) 11/14/2025 06/30/2027 HCOM - Primary Care Athens, Ohio, Dublin, Ohio, Cleveland, Ohio Position Description:The Heritage College is seeking applications for adjunct Instructors of Pharmacy to participate in the delivery of our integrated medical curriculum on our Athens, Cleveland, or Dublin, Ohio Campuses on an as needed basis. Selected instructors will join a diverse group of faculty in the Department of Primary Care, allowing the opportunity to gain training and expertise in a... View Details Bookmark Assistant/Associate Clinical Professor, Endocrinology or Diabetology, (Non Tenure Track) Part-Time, Athens Campus 11/14/2025 06/30/2027 HCOM - Specialty Medicine Athens, Ohio We are seeking an emerging or established clinical researcher with a focus on diabetes. This applicant will join a group of active, extramurally funded investigators within the Ohio University Diabetes Institute. This role is ideal for a physician interested in joining a team to gain experience in clinical research to contribute to the success of research programs that focus on the following to... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 Next Ohio University Human Resources | Grosvenor West 103 | 1 Ohio University | Athens, OH 45701| T: 740.593.1636 | F: 740.593.0386 Ohio University | Athens OH 45701 | 740.593.1000 ADA Compliance | © 2011 Ohio University. All rights reserved. uhr@ohio.edu To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
