rsity School of Nursing Zanesville Campus seeks adjunct clinical focus faculty candidates with an emphasis on teaching clinical competencies with Associate and Bachelor Degree Nursing students. These positions are term positions and will be filled as needs arise for the Zanesville campus.Faculty are expected to plan, implement, and evaluate instruction for student clinical and sim... View Details Bookmark School of Nursing Adjunct Clinical Faculty, Eastern Campus, Beginning Academic Year 2025-2026 (POOL POSTING) 04/24/2025 05/31/2026 ESTRN Nursing Eastern (St. Clairsville, Ohio) The Ohio University School of Nursing Eastern Campus seeks adjunct clinical focus faculty candidates with an emphasis on teaching clinical competencies with bachelor’s degree nursing students. These positions are term positions and will be filled as needs arise for the Eastern campus. Faculty are expected to plan, implement, and evaluate instruction for student clinical and simulation lab exper... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 Next Ohio University Human Resources | Grosvenor West 103 | 1 Ohio University | Athens, OH 45701| T: 740.593.1636 | F: 740.593.0386 Ohio University | Athens OH 45701 | 740.593.1000 ADA Compliance | © 2011 Ohio University. All rights reserved. uhr@ohio.edu To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
